3. identification from play when the forecast misses (25,600-game matches)
  match SE 1.82, forecast SE 4.56 Elo
  g = 4 J(1/2) - J(1): SE sqrt(17) se_m = 7.5
  A = 2 J(1) - 4 J(1/2): SE sqrt(20) se_m = 8.1
  C = L - g (labels' offset: opponent coins, non-exchangeable curvature): SE 8.8
  the design's alpha* = -G1 / (2 G2) with G1 = L: L estimates g + A when p = q/2 (midpoint), so it reads -(g + A) / (2 A); e.g. g 20, A -15 Elo: true 0.67, design 0.17

4. correction term's SE: 1.56 Elo at 12,800 games -> 1.10 at 25,600, 0.78 at 51,200
